<h3>MemeQA: Holistic Evaluation for Meme Understanding</h3>
Khoi P. N. Nguyen, Terrence Li, Derek Lou Zhou, Gabriel Xiong, Pranav Balu, Nandhan Alahari, Alan Huang, Tanush Chauhan, Harshavardhan Bala, Emre Guzelordu, Affan Kashfi, Aaron Xu, Suyesh Shrestha, Megan Vu, Jerry Wang, and Vincent Ng.
<br>
<i>Proceedings of the 63rd Annual Meeting of the Association for Computational Linguistics</i>, pp. 18926-18946, 2025. 


<p>Click here for the <a href="acl25.pdf">PDF</a> version. 
